Client version identifier
-------------------------
As the Soulseek.NET Additional Terms (section 5) require, soulget logs in with
its own client version: major 170 (fixed by Soulseek.NET), minor 20261020.
At the time of choosing (20 October 2026) this number was outside every range
listed as reserved in the Soulseek.NET README (760-7699999: slskd) and different
from the library's former default (100).

